{"title":"2004 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 10","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solutions\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solutions</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#See_also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The sum of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/4/c/34c8e6bf4d57cd6f2bb0d7d43e00f0f442f53b84.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$49$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"17\" height=\"13\" /> consecutive integers is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/5/2/a525d21eef8ae26634719caaf9bd7a44343c1e6b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7^5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"17\" />. What is their <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Median\" title=\"Median\">median</a>?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/b/c/3bc841896b32476b661595a80d1794560f7fe4c8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text {(A)}\\ 7 \\qquad \\text {(B)}\\ 7^2\\qquad \\text {(C)}\\ 7^3\\qquad \\text {(D)}\\ 7^4\\qquad \\text {(E)}\\ 7^5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"359\" height=\"19\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solutions\">Solutions</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solutions\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p>The median of a sequence is the middle number of the sequence when the sequence is arranged in order. Since the integers are consecutive, the median is also the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mean\" title=\"Mean\">mean</a>, so the median is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/6/b/96bcda719c66822e5efa596be49aa1d38dfd46a2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{7^5}{49} = 7^3\\ \\mathrm{(C)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"94\" height=\"39\" />.\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p>Notice that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/a/d/aade6208b60ec87d99ff3f47a82b20a4e4a44b04.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$49\\cdot7^3=7^5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"90\" height=\"17\" />. So, our middle number (median) must be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/f/7/4f7116ef7aacb4a2193f1d6063463f9b5b946c9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7^3\\ \\mathrm{(C)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"51\" height=\"21\" /> since all the other terms can be grouped to form an additional <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/a/f/5afbad0b221f0ef70186fe70b08e6fc1efdd8dfa.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$48$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> copies <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/d/9/bd99228146175c61e5cca6be965d17c918d45cec.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7^3$\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" />. Adding them would give <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/5/2/a525d21eef8ae26634719caaf9bd7a44343c1e6b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7^5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"17\" />.  \n</p><p>Solution by franzliszt\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"2\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_12A\" title=\"2004 AMC 12A\">2004 AMC 12A</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_12A_Problems\" title=\"2004 AMC 12A Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_12A_Answer_Key\" title=\"2004 AMC 12A Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/community/c13\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"2004 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 9\">Problem 9</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"2004 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 11\">Problem 11</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2004 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2004 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2004 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2004 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2004 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2004 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"2004 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"2004 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"2004 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"2004 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"2004 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"2004 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"2004 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"2004 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 15\">15</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_16\" title=\"2004 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 16\">16</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_17\" title=\"2004 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 17\">17</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_18\" title=\"2004 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 18\">18</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_19\" title=\"2004 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 19\">19</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_20\" title=\"2004 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 20\">20</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_21\" title=\"2004 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 21\">21</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_22\" title=\"2004 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 22\">22</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_23\" title=\"2004 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 23\">23</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_24\" title=\"2004 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 24\">24</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_25\" title=\"2004 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 25\">25</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AMC_12_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"AMC 12 Problems and Solutions\"> All AMC 12 Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<div class=\"print\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;width:100%;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center\">\n<div>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><